      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Superbly situated 3/4 bed dormer bungalow style residence on c. 1 acre lakeside plot. Featuring a bright modern interior, the property enjoys excellent lake and garden views. Well located c. 3 miles north east of Bantry town off the Glengarriff road N71\r\nServices: Oil fired central heating, well water, private drainage, broadband available"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 1.5m x 1.5m \r\nTiled floor\r\n\r\nLounge - 7.5m x 7.0m \r\nFrench doors to patio, full glass wall with lake views, stone fireplace, staircase\r\n\r\nInner Hall - 2.0m x 1.0m \r\nHotpress\r\n\r\nKitchen - 3.0m x 0.28m \r\nTiled floor, painted wooden kitchen, electrci oven, hob and extractor, fridge, washing machine, closet\r\n\r\nStudy/Bedroom 4 - 3.8m x 2.8m \r\nGlass walls, lake views\r\n\r\nShower Room - 1.8m x 1.8m \r\nFully tiled, electric shower, wash hand basin, w.c. heated towel rail\r\n\r\nLanding - 4.5m x 1.5m \r\nSuperb lake views, wooden floor, storage closet\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.5m x 3.5m \r\nSuperb lake views, wooden floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.0m x 3.0m \r\nWooden floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.8m x 2.5m \r\nWooden floor, closet\r\n\r\nBathroom - 3.0m x 2.0m \r\nWooden floor, lake views, bath, wash hand basin, w.c.\r\n\r\n"
      },
